<title>UK: Panama expects INTEL privatisation result by May.</title>
<headline>Panama expects INTEL privatisation result by May.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The outcome of Panama's plan</p>
<p>to sell off 49 percent of state phone company INTEL should be known within the next three months, President Perez Balladares told reporters on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Balladares, on an official visit to Britain, said the process was on schedule and the decision made by April or May.</p>
<p>Cable and Wireless and GTE Corp had both qualified for the bidding, he added. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7770 (fax +44 171 583 7239)</p>
